==Notes==
*Requires [[Hordes of the Underdark]].
*This feat does not provide an [[attack bonus]]; it merely allows an unarmed character to penetrate X/+4 damage reduction.
*Magic [[gloves]] with an attack bonus also allow an unarmed character to penetrate damage reduction, often making this feat superfluous.

==Custom content notes==
*A custom class must have this feat in their feat list, or that class will not be able to select it as a general feat.
*The monk class technically is not a prerequisite for this feat, but without custom content it is effectively a prerequisite as that is the only standard way to get ''ki strike''.

